<title>UK: MERRILL LYNCH SETS WARRANTS ON PHILIPS .</title>
<headline>MERRILL LYNCH SETS WARRANTS ON PHILIPS .</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International has</p>
<p>issued one million American-style call warrants, on Philips N.V,</p>
<p>lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    200 NLG		   PREMIUM	30.83 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     25.03 NLG		 GEARING	6.87 X  </p>
<p> EXPIRATION	25.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	11.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  172 NLG						</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
